  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing User Requirements**\n\nI\'m currently dissecting the user\'s specific requests, particularly the exclusion of email fields in customer and vehicle master forms. This nuance will influence how I approach the design logic. I\'m focusing on the implications of this absence and the best method to accommodate this design choice. The goal is to avoid redundancy and streamline the process.\n\n\n**Adjusting Interface Layout**\n\nI\'m now focusing on layout adjustments. The immediate priority involves shifting the Interaction Pad to the right column. Additionally, I need to make the Customer Master and Resolution Status the primary focus in the main workspace, centralizing the core data entry points, and combining them, if possible. I\'m exploring how to best merge these elements for streamlined data logging.\n\n\n**Integrating Consultation History**\n\nI\'m now integrating the consultation history display. I\'m focusing on making saved consultation records easily viewable within the customer profile or main view. My objective is to create a dynamic timeline or accordion box that clearly shows saved logs with timestamps, agent names, statuses, and details, ensuring they\'re accessible and readily available. I\'m also ensuring seamless synchronization with the Kanban board.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 659179441
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
